<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- BAKKOLOSE- Tonga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">BaKkolose</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lugwalo LwaPawulu KuBaKkolose</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaKkolose</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kkol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lugwalo LwaPawulu Ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">BAKKOLOSE</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lugwalo kuBaKkolose lwakalembwa aMutumwa Pawulu (BaKkolose 1:1). Wakalemba lugwalo oolu naakali muntolongo, kuyeeyelwa kuti kuRoma, kuchiindi chaminyaka ili makumi musamu akkumi limwi kaali wazyalwa Kkirisitu. BaKkolose, aamwi aBaEfeso aFilimoni, ategwa magwalo amuntolongo mbukunga Pawulu wakalemba kalimuntolongo. Wakalemba lugwalo oolu kumbungano muchisi chaBaKkolose. Pawulu taakatalika mbungano ili muKkolose pe, mbuli mbaakamba muli (BaKkolose 2:1), pesi wakalipeda mutolo kulinjiyo. Zilakonzya kuti Epafurasi nguwakitalika imbungano mbukunga waalikuzwa kuKkolose.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawulu wakalikulipenzya ankaambo kanjisyo zitaluleme mumbungano yaBaKkolose. Wakabweeza chibela chilamfu nchakalemba atala anjiyo. Kwakali chibunga chabanaKkrisitu baJuda bakalikweezya kwaangila bamwi banaKkirisitu kutobela milawu yabaJuda kuzwa muChizuminano Chakale, ikapati kukupalulwa. Pawulu ulemba kapati kuti banaKkirisitu takwe pe nchibayanduula nikuba chimwi chintu pe kunze kwaKkirisitu kuchitila kuti batambulike kuli Leza (BaKkolose 1:15-20) alimwi kuti injisyo iyeeme mumizeezo yabuntu njabiyo (BaKkolose 2:8)</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu utalika lugwalo akujuzya imbungano ili muKkolose (BaKkolose 1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo ulemba atala abupati bwaKkirisitu ikapati kukuvwiila atala anjisyo yakubeja muKkolose (BaKkolose 1:3—3:4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbuli mubwiingi bwamagwalo aPawulu, umanisya chisela chitobela kapa malayilile kukupona kwabunaKkirisitu bululeme (BaKkolose 3:5—4:6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu umanisizya akujuzya amalayilile kuti lugwalo lukabalilwe ajulu mumbungano zimwi (BaKkolose 4:7-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Ime Pawulu, mutumwa waJesu Kkirisitu kwiinda mukuyanda kwaLeza aTimoti mukwesu, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Rom 1:7</ref>.</char></note>Kubasalali akubakwesu basyomekede muli Kkirisitu bali kuKkolose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Luzyalo aluumuno luzwa kuli Leza Taata wesu lube kulindinywe.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkombyo Yakupa Kuluumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:16">Ef 1:16</ref>.</char>
    </note> Tuluumba Leza chiindi choonse, Wisi waMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu, nitumukombela, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />nkaambo twakamvwa atala alusyomo lwanu muli Kkirisitu Jesu aluyando ndumulaalo kubasalali boonse, <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />nkaambo kabulangilizi ndumwakabikkilwa kujulu. Bwacheechi nchimwakamvwa kale mujwi lyakasimpe, lyamakani mabotu, <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />eelyo lyakasika kulindinywe. Mbuli munyika yoonse makani mabotu alikuzyala muchelo akukomena akati kanu, kuzwa mubuzuba nimwaakaamvwa akumvwisisya luzyalo lwaLeza mukasimpe koonse, <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Kkol 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Film23</ref>.</char></note> mbuli mbumwakayiiya kuli Epafarasi simulimuma uyandika. Ngusimulimu usyomekede waKkirisitu utuyimvwilidi <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />alimwi wakatuzibya luyando lwako muMuuya.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:15-17">Ef 1:15-17</ref>.</char>
    </note> Nkaambo kacheechi, kuzwa mubuzuba nitwakachimvwa, teetwakaleka pe kumukombela, katukumbila kuti muzuzigwe aluzibo lwakuyanda kwakwe mubusongo akumvwisisya koonse kwaMuuya, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />kuti mupone buumi bweelela kuMwami, buzwide kumubotezya, buzyala muchelo mumulimu woonse mubotu alimwi amukukomena muluzibo lwaLeza. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Amusungwazigwe munguzu zyoonse, mukwiinda mubulemu bwakwe bupati, akukakatila amoyo mulamfu, alukondo <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />akupa kuluumba kuli Taata, ooyo wakamuchita kuti mweelele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bamwi bakale </char></note> mukwaabana lukono lwabasalali mubwami bwamumuni. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:21">Ef 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:2">2:2</ref>.</char></note>Wakatuvuna kuzwa mubweendelezi bwamumudima alimwi wakatutola kubwami bwaMwana wakwe uyandwa, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />mulinguwe mutujene lufutuko, kulekelelwa kwazibi.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bupati BwaKkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 4:4">2 Kkor 4:4</ref>.</char>
    </note> Kkirisitu nguumukozyanisyo waLeza utaboneki pe, mutaanzi kuzilengwa zyoonse; <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />nkaambo mulinguwe zintu zyoonse zyakalengwa, kujulu aanyika, ziboneka azitabonwi, nikuba zyuuno zyabulemu nikuba bwendeelezi nibaba beendelezi, nikuba nguzu, zintu zyoonse zyakalengwa mukwiinda mulinguwe ankaambo kanguwe. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:22-31">Tus 8:22-31</ref>.</char></note> Ulikunembo kwazintu zyoonse, alimwi mulinguwe zintu zyoonse muzikamantene. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:15">Ef 4:15</ref>.</char></note> Nguumutwe wamubili, imbungano; nguumatalikilo, nguumutaanzi kuzwa kubafu, kuti muli zyoonse abe atala azyoonse. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Nkaambo Leza wakabotelwa kuti abe abukkalo bakwe boonse buzwiide muliKkirisitu, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />alimwi mukwiinda mulinguwe kube kubweedezya zintu zyoonse mulinguwe, nikuba anyika nikuba kujulu, kuchita luumuno mukwiinda mubulowa bwakatika achiingano chakwe.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Alimwi inywe, nimwakali kule abusinkondonyina mumuzeezo, nkaambo kamilimu yanu mibi, <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />pesi lino wakabweedezya ndinywe mumubili wakwe alufu lwakwe, kuti amupedekezye kunembo lyakwe kamuli basalali kamutakwe kampenda mpawo akutaba amulandu kunembo lyakwe, <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />kuti mwayiinkilila anembo mulusyomo, akulibatamika akuzyandamana, peepe kusunzuluka kubulangilizi bwamakani mabotu aayo ngimwakamvwa, akakambawukwa kuzilengwa zyoonse zili aansi ajulu, alimwi alingawo ime, ndiPawulu, ngindakabeda mukambawusi.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milimu YaPawulu Mbuli Mulanda waMbungano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Lino ndilakondwa mukupenzegwa kwangu nkaambo kanu, amubili yangu ndilamanisya eecho chilibula mukupenzegwa muliKkirisitu nkaambo kamubili wakwe, ooyo, ulinguwo mbungano, <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:2">Ef 3:2</ref>.</char></note> nkikaako ndakaba mukambawusi mukwiindila mumulimu usalala ngundakapegwa aLeza nkaambo kandinywe, kuchitila kuti ijwi lyaLeza uzibikane buzwide, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:9">Ef 3:9</ref>.</char></note> insiinswa yakasiswa kwachiindi amazyalani pesi lino yakachitwa kuti iyubununwe kubasalali bakwe. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Kulimbabo Leza waakasala kuti kuzibikane kuti mbupati biyeni buvubi bwabulemu bansiiswa kuli batamuzi pe Leza, chaamba Kkirisitu mulindinywe, bulangilizi bwabulemu. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Nguwe ngutukambawuka, katuchenjezya muntu woonse akuyiisya muntu woonse mubusongo boonse, kuti tukapedekezye muntu woonse kazulide muli Kkirisitu. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Nkaambo kacheechi ndilabeleka, kandizuzana anguzu zyakwe zyoonse mpati nzyakonzya kupa mulindime.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Nkaambo ndiyanda kuti muzibe kapati loko mundipengeleka nkaambo kanu, alimwi abaabo bali kuLayodisiya, abaabo boonse batanandibona, <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />kuti myoyo yabo ikasungwazigwe mbuli mbubakaswanizigwa aamwi muluyando, kuti babe abuvubi boonse oobo buzwa kukumvwisisya kwachoonzyo aluzibo lwansiiswa yaLeza, lwaKkirisitu, <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:3">Ay 45:3</ref>.</char></note>mulinguwe mubusisidwe boonse buvubi bwabusongo aluzibo.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Ndaamba eechi, kuchitila kuti kutabi muntu naba uumwi umweena amajwi ataluleme pe. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Nkaambo nikuba kuti nsiwo mumubili pe, anukuti ndilaamwi andinywe mumuuya, kandilikubotelwa kubona mabambe mabotu aanu amukujatisisya kwalusyomo lwanu muli Kkirisitu.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buumi Buzwide Muli Kkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Nkikaako mbuli mbumwakamutambula Kkirisitu Jesu mbuli Mwami, aboobo amupone mulinguwe, <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />kamuzyatide muyanda akuyakwa mulinguwe, akuyakwa mulusyomo, mbuli mbumwakayiisigwa, kamukkalilide mukupa kulumba.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Amuchenjelele kuti kutabi naba uumwi umuleyesya alweeno zyabuyo azeezyo ziyoomutola munzila italuleme, mukwiinda muziyanza zyabuntu, amukwiinda mumyuuya yanyika, alimwi itali mukwiinda muli Kkirisitu pe.<verse eid="COL 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Nkaambo mulinguwe mumubili wakwe woonse mubuzwide bunaLeza, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:21-22">Ef 1:21-22</ref>.</char></note> alimwi mwakeetwa kubuumi buzwide mulinguwe, nguunguwe mutwe wanguzu zyoonse abweendelezi.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Mulinguwe lubo mwakapalulwa abupalulwe butali bwakachitwa amaanza pe, akugwisya nyama mumubili mukwiinda mubupalulwe bwakachitwa aKkirisitu; <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />alimwi mwakavwikkwa aamwi anguwe mulubbapatizyo, oomo mumwakabusigwa aamwi anguwe lubo kwiinda mulusyomo lulimunguzu zyaLeza, ooyo wakamubusya kuzwa kubafu. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Alimwi inywe, nimwakalifwide muzibi amukutapalulwa kwamibili yanu, Leza wakamubusya aamwi aKkirisitu, kali watulekelela milandu yesu yoonse, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />wakamweya eeyo milandu yakali kutwaanga kumulawu; eeyi wakibikka ambali, akuyigankamina achiingano. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:21">Ef 1:21</ref>.</char></note> Nakamana kumwayisya beendelezi anguzu akuchita chitondezyo chabo antanganana, kali kubazunda imwini mukwiinda muchiingano chakwe.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:16. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:1-12">Rom 14:1-12</ref>.</char>
    </note> Nkikaako kutabi naba uumwi umubeteka atala achakulya nikuba kunywa nikuba kubamba ipobwe nikuba kukkala kwamweezi nikuba buzuba bwasabata. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:23">Ef 1:23</ref>.</char></note> Eezi mweenzule luzutu wacheecho chiyoobuza; pesi chachoonzyo nguKkirisitu lwakwe. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Kutabi naba uumwi umubeteka, kutabi naba uumwi upawupa kukulifwinsya akukomba baangelo, akukakatila kuzilengano, bazwide kulikankayizya amizeezo yabuntu, <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:22">Ef 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:16">4:16</ref>.</char></note>alimwi kutali kujatilila kuMutwe, ooko nkunkuko mubili woonse, kukutawukilwa amukukamantana aamwi mukwiinda mukuswanizya amalambi Nikuli, zilakomena akukomezya kuzwa kuliLeza.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufwa aKubuka Aamwi aKkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:20. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 4:3">Gal 4:3</ref>.</char>
    </note> Kuti aKkirisitu mwakafwa aamwi munguzu zyamyuuya yanyika, nkaamboonzi nimuchipona mbuli bakunyika? Nkaamboonzi nimulibombya kumilawu, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Mutajati,” “Mutalabili,” “Mutagumi”? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Ay 29:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:7">Mkk 7:7</ref>.</char></note> Zintu eezyo zyoonse zilooba mbuli mukubeleka kwazyo, mukwiinda mumalayilile anjiisyo zyamuntu? <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Zintu eezi zilimubwiime bwabusongo akusungwazya bukombi bwabo akulibombya kwabubeji akubelesya chabukali kumubili, pesi nzyabiyo mukulanga muli zyamubili.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Int 110:1</ref>.</char>
    </note> Eelyo kuti naa mwakabusigwa aamwi aKkirisitu, amuyandule zintu zili kujulu, ooko Kkirisitu nkwabede, nkwakkede kuluboko lwakululyo lwaLeza. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Amupangike miyeeyo yanu kuzintu zili kujulu, peepe kuzintu eezyo zili anyika, <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />nkaambo inywe mwakafwa, alimwi buumi bwanu bulisisidwe aamwi aKkirisitu muli Leza. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Aawo Kkirisitu ooyu ulingunguwe buumi bwesu akuliboniya, eelyo muyooliboniya aamwi anguwe mubulemu.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buumi Bukulukulu aBuumi Bupya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Nkikaako amujeye eezyo zyamunyika zili mulindinywe, zilimbuli malalano abusofwazi azisusi zyamubili aziyandisyo zyabubi abusindya alimwi chaamba kukomba mituni. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Nkaambo kazintu eezi bukali bwaLeza bulikuza.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bamwi bakale bakazumizya kuyundizizgwe ajulu kuti atala abana bakutaswilila</char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Muli zeezi mumwakali kweendela, nimwakali kupona mulinzizyo.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Pesi lino amusowe zyoonse eezi, zilimbuli lunyemo abukali kusula akusampawula alimwi amatusi kuzwa mumulomo wako. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Mutabejelani pe, mbukunga mwakazuununa buntu bukulukulu anchito zyayo <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Matl 1:26</ref>.</char></note>alimwi mwakasama buntu bupya, chaamba kubukulisigwa muluzibo lwakwe amuchiimo chayooyo wakachilenga. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Aawa takukwe muGirikki nikuba muJuda, bapalulwe abatapalwidwe, utayiide bazwakule amuzike amuntu wangunukide, pesi Kkirisitu nguunguwe zyoonse amuli zyoonse.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:2">Ef 4:2</ref>.</char>
    </note> Nkikaako mbuli basale baLeza, basalali alimwi bayandwa loko amusame aluse abuuya abazikatide akulifwiinsya alimwi amoyo mulamfu, <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />kamukkazikilene moyo alimwi naakuti umwi wanu ujisi kaambo atala amweenzinyina, amulekelelane; mbuli Mwami mbwakamulekelela, aboobo alubo mweelede kulekelela. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Alimwi atala azintu zyoonse eezi amube aluyando, oolu nduundulo lukamantaniya aamwi zintu zyoonse munzila iluleme. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Amuleke luumuno lwaKkirisitu lwendeelezye mumyoyo yanu, mulindulo mumwaakayitwa mumubili uumwi. Alimwi amupe kulumba. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19">Ef 5:19</ref>.</char></note>Amuleke ijwi lyaKkirisitu likkalilile mulindinywe mubwiingi bwalyo, amuyiisye akusungilizyaniya mubusongo boonse, amukwiimba intembawuzyo amalelebu anyimbo zyamuMuuya anyimbo zyakupa kulumba mumoyo yanu kuliLeza. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Alimwi kufumbwa nzimuchita, mujwi nikuba mukuchita, amuzichite zintu zyoonse mukwiinda muzina lyaMwami Jesu, kamupa kulumba kuliLeza Taata mukwiinda mulinguwe.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulyidilani Bwako Mubuumi Bupya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18—4:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22-6:9">Ef 5:22—6:9</ref>.</char>
    </note> Nibanakazi, amulibombye kubalumi banu, mbuli mbulikweleede muMwami.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Nibalumi, amuyande banakazi banu, alimwi mutabaluvukili.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Nibana, amuswilile bazyali banu muzintu zyoonse, nkaambo eechi chibotezya Mwami.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />NimaTaata, mutabanyemwi bana banu, nkaambo balawusa.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Nibazike, amuswiilile basimalelo banu baansi muzintu zyoonse, peepe nibabwene, mbuli basikubotelezya bantu, pesi mukuchita zizwa mukati kamoyo, mukuyoowa Mwami. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:11">Rom 12:11</ref>.</char></note> Kufumbwa nzimuyoochita, amuchite amoyo woonse, mbuli kubelekela Mwami alimwi peepe bantu, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />kamuzi kuti kuzwa kuMwami muyotambula lukono mbuli mpindu yanu; peepe iswe pesi nguMwami Kkirisitu mukukutawukila. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Nkaambo simuchita zibi uyoojana mpindu yabubi mbwachita, alimwi takukwe kusalulwa pe.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 25:43">Lev 25:43</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 25:53">53</ref>.</char>
    </note>Nibasimalelo, amupe zyelelo zyeleede kubazike banu, nkaambo mulizizi kuti alanu mula Simalelo ulikujulu.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malayilile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:2. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:12">Rom 12:12</ref>.</char>
    </note> Amwinkilile anembo chakutaleka mukukomba, alimwi kamuli abulangilizi akupa kulumba; <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />alimwi kamutukombela andiswe, kuti Leza atujulile mweenya wajwi, kuti tukakonzye kukambawuka insiiswa yaKkirisitu, nkaambo kayo lino ndilimubwaange, <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />kuchitila kuti ndikonzye kwibikka antanganana, mbuli mbundeelede kwaambuula. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:16">Ef 5:16</ref>.</char></note> Amweende mubusongo kulibaabo batamuzi Leza, akubelesya kabotu mweenya woonse ngumulawo. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Lino kuyooma kwanu akube kwaluzyalo, akondeelezya, kuchitila kuti mukazibe mbuumuyovwiila boonse.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujuzya Kwakumamanino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Ef 6:21-22</ref>.</char>
    </note> Tayikkikkasi uyomwaambila atala abuumi bwangu; ooyu mukwesu ngundiyandisya alimwi mukambawusi usyomekede mulanda muMwami. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Ndilikumutuma kulindinywe nkaambo kacheechi, kuti mukazibe mbutubede akuti akasungwazye myoyo yanu, <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10">Film10</ref>.</char></note> anguwe Onisimasi, mukwesu usyomekede awuyandwa, ulingunguwe umwi wanu. Bayomwaambila zyoonse ezyo zilikuchitika kulindiswe okuno.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Inch 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film24</ref>.</char>
    </note> Arisitakkasi, mwaangema, ulamujuzya, aMakki, mujwa awisi aBbanabbasi. (Ooyu ngumwakatambula malayilile kuti Makki waza kulindinywe, mumutambule), <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />alimwi Jesu, utegwa nguJasitasi alakwe ulamujuzya. Aaba batatu mbimbabo abalikke baalumi babupalulwe akati kabasimulimuma nkaambo kabwami bwaLeza, alimwi mbimbabo bakali kunduumbulizya.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kkol 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Film23</ref>.</char>
    </note>Epafarasi, ooyu uli nguunguwe umwi wanu, mulanda waKkirisitu Jesu, ulamujuzya, ulamuyeeya kapati lyoonse munkombyo zyakwe, kuti mukonzye kwimikila nji amukumaninina kuzwide mukuyanda kwaLeza koonse. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Nkaambo ndimujisilidi bukamboni kuti wakamubelekela changuzu abaabo bali kuLayodisiya abaabo bali muHayirapolisi. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10-11">2 Tim 4:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film24</ref>.</char></note> Lukku musilisi muuyandisi aDimasi balamujuzya.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Mundijuzizye bakwesu balimu Layodisiya aNayifasi ambungano ilimuŋanda yakwe. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Alimwi kuti lugwalo oolu lwakumana kubalwa akati kanu, mukalubale lubo mumbungano yakuLayodisiya; mpawo mukabone kuti lwabalwa lubo lugwalo luzwa kuLayodisiya. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Alimwi mukati kuli Akkipasi, “Ulaange kuti wazuzikizya mulimu ooyu nguwataambula muMwami.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 16:21">1 Kkor 16:21</ref>.</char>
    </note> Ime, Pawulu, ndilimulembela kujuzya ooku aluboko lwangu. Amuyeeye kuti ndili angidwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Luzyalo lwaLeza Lube andinywe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Luzyalo lube andinywe.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>